# Code owners for Family Hub. See docs/maintainers/repo-setup.md, section 5.
#
# BEFORE ENABLING THE RULESET: replace every @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER below
# with the maintainer's GitHub handle. The placeholder is deliberately not a
# valid handle (handles cannot contain underscores), so GitHub shows an error
# until it is replaced. The maintainer's handle is on the PII check's blocklist
# (scripts/check-pii.mjs), so adding it also needs that check to skip this file.
# With "Require review from Code Owners" on, a pull request needs an approval
# from an owner of every file it changes. Later rules win over earlier ones.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER

# Sensitive paths: access control, PIN, outbound fetches, the assistant
# bridge, the container, scripts and repository automation. Keep these owned
# by core maintainers only, even after skill owners or other maintainers are
# added to the default rule above.
/src/app/api/**         @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/src/proxy.ts           @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/src/lib/session.ts     @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/src/lib/guard.ts       @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/src/lib/auth.ts        @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/src/lib/pin-attempts.ts @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/src/lib/safe-fetch.ts  @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/bridge/**              @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/Dockerfile             @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/docker-compose*.yml    @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/docker/**              @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/scripts/**             @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
/.github/**             @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER
